      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我和空中救世主一同点头。\n没错，一路跑完古马级赛事后，\n总算稍微安定下来――",
      "source_fingerprint": "89b230d9abeb56fd81f10c160110fc7c65c42cd13429244f3a8671648bbcc082",
